  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libscca

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libscca/archive/refs/tags/20260527.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libscca-20260527-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libscca-20260527-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libscca-20260527-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libscca-20260527-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libscca1-20260527-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libscca-devel-20260527-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libscca-20260527-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libscca)
  /usr/bin/sccainfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libscca.README
  /usr/share/doc/libscca/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libscca/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libscca/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libscca/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libscca/README
